<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 379)</h2>
<p><b>Exports can publish themselves.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>A new plugin seam, <code>export_target</code>, hands every finished export — movies, frame grabs, reports, session packages — to a studio's own delivery script: upload it, file it, attach it to a tracker, anything. The export itself is never blocked; a failing target reports its own message. Contract in PLUGINS.md, same drop-in mechanics as the other seams.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
