<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 376)</h2>
<p><b>Session packages: frame sequences become playable movies.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Exporting a session package at the HEVC or ProRes tier now renders EXR/DPX sequences into review movies through each clip's own color pipeline — the package is playable anywhere instead of carrying folders of raw frames. The Originals tier still copies frames verbatim, and the packaged session references whatever was written.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
